wordstat counts or ranks the words of a text, read from its arguments or from --file.

Usage:
  wordstat [command]

Available Commands:
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  count       Count the words, lines or characters of a text
  help        Help about any command
  top         List the most frequent words of a text

Flags:
  -f, --file string   read the text from this file instead of the arguments
  -h, --help          help for wordstat

Use "wordstat [command] --help" for more information about a command.
